## Legacy releases

Copies of Punk IP Illustrations that were previously distributed under the
MIT License remain available under the MIT License that accompanied those
copies. The license change does not revoke or restrict rights already granted
for those legacy copies.

No GitHub release tag marked the last MIT snapshot at the time of this change.
If a last MIT identifier is tagged later, the recommended tag is `v1.0.0-mit`.
The MIT text that previously applied is preserved in
[LICENSE-MIT-LEGACY](./LICENSE-MIT-LEGACY).

